{"id":"n26573-1-8","stage":5,"title":"개수 · 个数","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n26573-1-8-1","ko":"반찬을 담을 그릇이 모자라네.","zh":"装配菜的碗不够用啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"반찬을","meaning":"菜，菜肴","explanation":"반찬：菜，菜肴；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"반찬","audio":"/audio/dae8746e5842e5da92d0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57641","senseId":"1","lemma":"반찬","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"반찬을","audio":"/audio/25c3d5e150ae2a815837.mp3"}},{"text":"담을","meaning":"装，盛","explanation":"담다：装，盛；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"담다","audio":"/audio/41232b29db6bd744f882.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73283","senseId":"1","lemma":"담다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"담을","audio":"/audio/ff8a428b081c954b56dd.mp3"}},{"text":"그릇이","meaning":"碗，器皿","explanation":"그릇：碗，器皿；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"그릇","audio":"/audio/7e60f5c15633cdc1f60c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31674","senseId":"1","lemma":"그릇","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그릇이","audio":"/audio/4441b24104e384139e9f.mp3"}},{"text":"모자라네.","meaning":"不够，不足","explanation":"모자라다：不够，不足；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"모자라다","audio":"/audio/05ceb5dfc162d026352d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"46143","senseId":"1","lemma":"모자라다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모자라네","audio":"/audio/d82557380a8a0cc53ab3.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"dae8746e5842e5da","term":"반찬","zh":"菜，菜肴","audio":"/audio/dae8746e5842e5da92d0.mp3","entryId":"57641","definition":"用餐时配着米饭一起吃的食物。","pronunciation":["반찬"]},{"id":"41232b29db6bd744","term":"담다","zh":"装，盛","audio":"/audio/41232b29db6bd744f882.mp3","entryId":"73283","definition":"把某物装进器皿里等。","pronunciation":["담ː따"]},{"id":"7e60f5c15633cdc1","term":"그릇","zh":"碗，器皿","audio":"/audio/7e60f5c15633cdc1f60c.mp3","entryId":"31674","definition":"盛食物的器具。","pronunciation":["그륻"]},{"id":"05ceb5dfc162d026","term":"모자라다","zh":"不够，不足","audio":"/audio/05ceb5dfc162d026352d.mp3","entryId":"46143","definition":"达不到规定的数量或程度。","pronunciation":["모ː자라다"]}],"audio":"/audio/b2a5c8f08db355235d25.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n26573-1-8-2","ko":"내가 부족한 개수만큼 더 가져올게.","zh":"我会再拿一些，补上缺少的数量。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"내가","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내가","audio":"/audio/7ee3e480d2ca3192b2bc.mp3"}},{"text":"부족한","meaning":"不足，缺乏，不够，欠缺","explanation":"부족하다：不足，缺乏，不够，欠缺；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"부족하다","audio":"/audio/3dd9c5f65c6da41a8a1c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59849","senseId":"1","lemma":"부족하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"부족한","audio":"/audio/147c7d12c546a22b71fa.mp3"}},{"text":"개수만큼","meaning":"个数","explanation":"개수：个数；만큼：表示程度相当：“像……一样、达到……程度”。","readings":[{"term":"개수","audio":"/audio/061d19741e555dba612d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26573","senseId":"1","lemma":"개수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"개수만큼","audio":"/audio/603087d48965d9149c99.mp3"}},{"text":"더","meaning":"再，多","explanation":"더：再，多","readings":[{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26829","senseId":"1","lemma":"더","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}},{"text":"가져올게.","meaning":"带来，拿来，取来","explanation":"가져오다：带来，拿来，取来；ㄹ게：向对方表达说话人的决定或承诺，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"가져오다","audio":"/audio/13f6f1041daf74b52d00.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"53818","senseId":"1","lemma":"가져오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가져올게","audio":"/audio/e8c5ae12ca12b4ddc12a.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"3dd9c5f65c6da41a","term":"부족하다","zh":"不足，缺乏，不够，欠缺","audio":"/audio/3dd9c5f65c6da41a8a1c.mp3","entryId":"59849","definition":"未能达到需要的数量或基准，不充裕。","pronunciation":["부조카다"]},{"id":"061d19741e555dba","term":"개수","zh":"个数","audio":"/audio/061d19741e555dba612d.mp3","entryId":"26573","definition":"一个一个数的东西的数量。","pronunciation":["개ː쑤"]},{"id":"1e2cb79b6970d021","term":"더","zh":"再，多","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3","entryId":"26829","definition":"添补而继续。","pronunciation":["더"]},{"id":"13f6f1041daf74b5","term":"가져오다","zh":"带来，拿来，取来","audio":"/audio/13f6f1041daf74b52d00.mp3","entryId":"53818","definition":"把某个东西从一个地方搬到另一个地方。","pronunciation":["가저오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/87da695fa285025da968.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.287,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=26573","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":157,"sequenceScore":3.1137,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我会再拿一些，补上缺少的数量。","你新买了鞋吗？","装配菜的碗不够用啊。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我会再拿一些，补上缺少的数量。","装配菜的碗不够用啊。","你新买了鞋吗？"],"answer":0}]}
